      <rules>
        <rule id="1028-854c-48cc-0f90" name="Wizard" hidden="false">
          <description>Magic level 2; normally receive 2 spells before battle. High Magic uses its own draw-and-discard procedure. Body armour and shields prevent spellcasting; steed barding does not. Book of Ashur/Crown of Sorcery effects and spell-deck changes require manual application. Warhammer Magic pp. 7–8, 18; Wood Elves p. 65.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
