      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="f6ab-84be-6f6d-a5f7" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 360 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="5a7c-3aef-4df0-05f4" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>None.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="2404-0efb-3c76-62f7" name="Ancient Treeman" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="76–77">
          <description>Moves through woods without penalty. Woody skin gives a 4+ save, replacing the ordinary Treeman’s 5+. Flaming weapons and spells cause double wounds. Hates Orcs, Goblins and Dwarfs. Uses the normal Tree Whack and fallen Treeman rules. He is paid from Characters and does not consume the ordinary Treeman allowance. Reference: Woodelves, printed p. 76–77.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="1650-dad4-f597-5f82" name="Swarm of Sprites" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="76–77">
          <description>In shooting inflict D6 automatic Strength 3 hits on the nearest enemy within 12 inches. If Durthu is in combat, attack his melee opponents instead. Sprites cannot be attacked and vanish if Durthu dies. Reference: Woodelves, printed p. 76–77.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="e63b-bbed-cace-c46f" name="Fear" targetId="7c4f-53c7-b87a-c8ff" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="48–49" />
        <infoLink id="6050-3d84-3edd-b6cf" name="Hatred" targetId="808b-03fc-ab40-aacf" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="51" />
        <infoLink id="d601-4d83-2f72-ea3e" name="Treeman abilities" targetId="937b-36bb-fab8-ed84" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="50, 68" />
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="4863-2bcf-b361-1405" name="Scarloc" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="77">
