          <description>Unique named selection. 166 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="f29e-db92-b11b-29f9" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Sword; longbow; light armour; shield.</description>
        </rule>
