      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="137e-92a9-a8b1-95aa" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 60 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="9bf5-8197-edd8-efcf" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>None.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="597b-f828-8cbd-2e32" name="Dirge of the Dryad" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="78">
          <description>In either player’s magic phase, the nearest enemy within 12 inches tests Leadership. Failure prevents moving and shooting in its following turn; it can defend itself in combat but strikes last. Reference: Woodelves, printed p. 78.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0ffb-797d-7830-e28b" name="Dryad powers" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="78">
          <description>No woodland movement penalty; immune to psychology. Magical aura saves wounds on 4+, including magical and flaming attacks. Takes the same tree aspect as her unit; see the Dryad rule for aspect effects. Reference: Woodelves, printed p. 78.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="b604-1f99-733b-a02c" name="Dryad protection and aspects" targetId="b49b-65fd-934b-70ba" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="2e06-8dc0-e774-819f" page="52" />
        <infoLink id="dad5-06ad-bf97-7457" name="Champions, characters and challenges" targetId="c172-7f3e-b5a2-05ea" type="rule" hidden="false" publicationId="d7c9-7773-4408-58f6" page="59–67" />
